@startuml insight-x-sequence-run
' 创建任务并执行分析 + 代码优化扩展（与 sequence-analysis-run.mermaid 对应）
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
title Insight-X — 典型调用：任务创建 → 数据分析 → 代码优化 Patch

actor "客户端\nHTTP/API Client" as C
participant "REST 入口\nFastAPI" as API
database "任务/结果/优化\n内存缓存" as Mem
participant "分析流水线\nAnalysisOrchestrator" as Orch
participant "代码优化流水线\nCodeOptimizationOrchestrator" as CORCH
participant "数据理解 Agent①\nDataUnderstandingAgent" as A1
participant "策略设计 Agent②\nAnalysisStrategyAgent" as A2
participant "代码生成 Agent③\nCodeGenerationAgent" as A3
participant "执行分析 Agent④\nCodeExecutionAgent" as A4
participant "洞察生成 Agent⑤\nInsightGenerationAgent" as A5
participant "代码优化分析 Agent⑥-1\nCodeOptimizationAnalysisAgent" as A61
participant "埋点策略 Agent⑥-2\nTrackingStrategyAgent" as A62
participant "代码实现 Agent⑦\nCodeImplementationAgent" as A7
participant "异步数据库访问\nDatabaseConnector" as DB
participant "大模型统一封装\nLLMClient" as LLM
participant "沙箱执行\nSandboxExecutor" as SB
participant "Git 服务\nGitService" as GIT

== 1. 创建与运行数据分析任务 ==

C -> API : POST /api/v1/tasks
API -> Mem : 保存 AnalysisTask (PENDING)
API --> C : task_id

C -> API : POST /api/v1/tasks/{id}/run
API -> Mem : mark_running()
API -> Orch : run_analysis(task)

Orch -> A1 : execute_with_context(...)
A1 -> DB : schema / 表名 / 抽样
DB --> A1 : 元数据与样本
A1 -> LLM : 数据理解 Prompt
LLM --> A1 : JSON 数据字典
A1 --> Orch : DataDictionary

Orch -> A2 : execute(strategy input)
A2 -> LLM : 策略 Prompt
LLM --> A2 : 分析计划 JSON
A2 --> Orch : strategy

Orch -> A3 : execute(code gen input)
A3 -> LLM : 代码生成 Prompt
LLM --> A3 : Python 源码
A3 --> Orch : generated_code

Orch -> A4 : execute(代码 + db_config)
A4 -> SB : execute(...线程池包装)
SB --> A4 : ExecutionResult
A4 --> Orch : ExecutionResult

note over Orch, A5
执行失败仍进入洞察，
stats 可为空 {}
end note

Orch -> A5 : execute(data_dict + stats)
A5 -> LLM : 洞察 Prompt
LLM --> A5 : Insight 列表
A5 --> Orch : insights

Orch --> API : AnalysisResult
API -> Mem : 写入结果 COMPLETED
API --> C : AnalysisResultResponse

== 2. 代码优化扩展（Agent 6-1 / 6-2 / 7 按需触发） ==

C -> API : POST /api/v1/tasks/{id}/code-optimization\n{repo_url, branch}
API -> Mem : 读取 insights
API -> CORCH : run_code_optimization(...)
CORCH -> GIT : clone_and_snapshot(repo_url)
GIT --> CORCH : CodeRepository(files, tech_stack)
CORCH -> A61 : execute(insights + repo)
A61 -> LLM : 代码优化分析 Prompt
LLM --> A61 : CodeChangeSuggestion[]
A61 --> CORCH : suggestions
CORCH --> API : suggestions
API -> Mem : 写入 _code_opt_store
API --> C : CodeOptimizationResponse

C -> API : POST /api/v1/tasks/{id}/tracking-strategy\n{repo_url, branch}
API -> Mem : 读取 insights + business_doc
API -> CORCH : run_tracking_strategy(...)
CORCH -> GIT : clone_and_snapshot(repo_url)
GIT --> CORCH : CodeRepository
CORCH -> A62 : execute(insights + repo + doc)
A62 -> LLM : 埋点策略 Prompt
LLM --> A62 : TrackingStrategyReport
A62 --> CORCH : report
CORCH --> API : report
API -> Mem : 写入 _tracking_store
API --> C : TrackingStrategyResponse

C -> API : POST /api/v1/tasks/{id}/code-implementation\n{repo_url, use_code_optimization, use_tracking_strategy}
API -> Mem : 读取 suggestions + report
API -> CORCH : run_code_implementation(...)
CORCH -> GIT : clone_and_snapshot(repo_url)
GIT --> CORCH : CodeRepository
CORCH -> A7 : execute(repo + suggestions + report)
A7 -> LLM : 代码实现 Prompt (按文件)
LLM --> A7 : 修改后的源码
A7 -> A7 : difflib.unified_diff()
A7 --> CORCH : CodeImplementationOutput
CORCH --> API : impl
API -> Mem : 写入 _code_impl_store
API --> C : CodeImplementationResponse

C -> API : GET /api/v1/tasks/{id}/patch
API -> Mem : 聚合 diff
API --> C : { filename, patch }

@enduml
